File name: NARNLOOP.MP
Path description: Newhaven Arena loop (with Healing)
Path starts: Newhaven Arena
Path ends: ---
Area of the game: OG
Level recommendation: 1-5
Type of path: Loop
File format: New
Monsters encountered: lashworm, carrion beast, giant rat, filthbug,
                      acid slime, kobold thief.
Additional information:

This loop buys healing at the temple healer, which is gets you a higher
exp rate, but costs money. To set MegaMud up to do this, set your rest HPs
at 0, run HPs at a reasonable level, and make sure you have lots of cash.
